14
00:00:41,076 --> 00:00:43,446
(Leonard:)Yeah, special, like that.

15
00:00:44,279 --> 00:00:46,859
(Leonard:)That's them.

16
00:00:46,865 --> 00:00:47,865
(Leonard:)Please don't make things

17
00:00:47,866 --> 00:00:49,836
